  "result": "Baseline exact. Three natural forms across seven compiler versions all leave two aligned edits from an early incoming stack load. Reference-based RNG helpers retain that residual; a value-returning RNG helper is worse. No candidate accepted.",
  "next_evidence": "Recover genuine incoming-parameter alias and scheduler dependencies, not another equivalent arithmetic or compiler sweep.",
  "frontier_source": "#include \"types.h\"\n\nextern const int lbl_800911E0[16];\n\n#define CLAMP_SAMPLE(x)                 \\\n    if ((x) > 32767 || (x) < -32768) {  \\\n        if ((x) < -32768) {             \\\n            (x) = -32768;               \\\n        } else if ((x) > 32767) {       \\\n            (x) = 32767;                \\\n        }                               \\\n    }\n\nint fn_8004F55C(const signed char *input, int num_blocks, short *output, short delay[2],\n                short coefficient0, short coefficient1, short *random_state,\n                short random_multiplier, short random_increment) {\n    int block;\n    int i;\n    int older;\n    int previous;\n    short gain;\n\n        previous = delay[0];\n    older = delay[1];\n    for (block = 0; block < num_blocks; block++) {\n        short code = *(const short *)input;\n\n        if (code & 0x8000) return block;\n        gain = ((code ^ *random_state) & 0x1fff) + 1;\n        *random_state = random_increment + *random_state * random_multiplier;\n        *random_state &= 0x7fff;\n        input += 2;\n        for (i = 0; i < 16; i++) {\n            int packed = *input;\n            int decoded;\n\n            input++;\n            decoded = (packed >> 4) * gain +\n                ((coefficient0 * previous + coefficient1 * older) >> 12);\n            CLAMP_SAMPLE(decoded);\n            output[0] = decoded;\n            packed = lbl_800911E0[packed & 15];\n            previous = packed * gain +\n                ((coefficient0 * decoded + coefficient1 * previous) >> 12);\n            CLAMP_SAMPLE(previous);\n            output[1] = previous;\n            older = decoded;\n            output += 2;\n        }\n    }\n        delay[0] = previous;\n    delay[1] = older;\n    return num_blocks;\n}\n\n",
  "replay": "Extract frontier_source to PATH, then uv run tools/fzgx.py fixup fn_8004F55C --body PATH --output SCRATCH_DIRECTORY --rounds 0; the unit retains GC/1.3.2 and -use_lmw_stmw on."
